    {"role": "patient", "text": "From last time the flare ups are down to once a week, if memory serves."},
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "Okay. The letter has you on amitriptyline 10 milligrams at night, and codeine 30 milligrams up to four times a day when it flares."},
    {"role": "patient", "text": "That's right, though I've barely touched the codeine."},
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "Good. I'd guess the flares are linked to the long shifts, but that's just a hunch."},
